{"id":"n16106-2-9","stage":2,"title":"메우다 · 挤满","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16106-2-9-1","ko":"차들이 도로를 꽉 메우고 있어.","zh":"路上的车挤得水泄不通啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"차들이","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차들이","audio":"/audio/956ca31bd2d693c87ffa.mp3"}},{"text":"도로를","meaning":"道路，公路","explanation":"도로：道路，公路；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"도로","audio":"/audio/60982a61e50d3bea9c66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47886","senseId":"1","lemma":"도로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도로를","audio":"/audio/b1044a5c9a5838acc5d1.mp3"}},{"text":"꽉","meaning":"挤，紧身","explanation":"꽉：挤，紧身","readings":[{"term":"꽉","audio":"/audio/991291daac49a3be8f11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14647","senseId":"3","lemma":"꽉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽉","audio":"/audio/991291daac49a3be8f11.mp3"}},{"text":"메우고","meaning":"挤满，填满，塞满","explanation":"메우다：挤满，填满，塞满；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"메우다","audio":"/audio/1edc895e834c598b2c9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16106","senseId":"2","lemma":"메우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"메우고","audio":"/audio/99788a4683f3c87df514.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronuncia